body:
@anboo @hugomonfouga 

If you guys run `rm -rf var/cache/*`, do you still get the error?

In both cases, you *definitely* have the `SecurityBundle` installed and enabled. And IF this bundle is enabled, then you will have the `security.http_utils` service 100% of the time. So, I can't see how you have this error. That's why I'm wondering if there is a stale cache that is causing problems.
